914 0 obj
<</Type /StructElem
/S /Figure
/Alt (Cover of the PhylogenyPro manual: a sequence alignment unravels into branches that climb through the real color bands of the geological time scale until they become a dated tree, whose tips carry a leaf, a fruit and a drop of copal resin, a flower, a conifer cone and a fern; at the nodes there are pies of ancestral states and a fossil mark that calibrates an age, and at the foot, two vignettes: a circular tree and a split network.)
